WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Measure test effectiveness
with explicit denominators.

00:00:03.465 --> 00:00:08.800
Compare detected critical faults
with the approved viable fault catalogue.

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:12.880
Compare completed critical scenarios
with the frozen matrix, keeping

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:16.880
skipped cases visible.
Compare complete decision records

00:00:16.976 --> 00:00:21.040
with every submitted release
candidate, including missing packs.

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:26.080
The clean control must pass
and the intended fault must fail.

00:00:26.227 --> 00:00:29.240
These are proposed acceptance measures.

00:00:29.298 --> 00:00:31.840
Coverage and a complete
evidence pack can still

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.920
support a decision to stop a release.
